| 1 | Lockfile current | `uv lock --check` | `uv lock` | project | pre-commit | every push | n/a |
| 2 | Format | `uv run --locked ruff format --check` | `uv run --locked ruff format` | changed files | pre-commit | every push | ruff.toml |
| 3 | Lint | `uv run --locked ruff check` | `uv run --locked ruff check --fix` (reviewed) | changed files | pre-commit | every push | ruff.toml |
| 4 | Types | TYPE_CHECK_COMMAND | none | project | pre-push | every push | type checker config |
| 5 | Import contracts | `uv run --locked lint-imports` | none | project | pre-commit | every push | .importlinter |
| 6 | Docs and spelling | SPELL_AND_MARKDOWN_COMMANDS | markdownlint `--fix` | changed files | pre-commit | every push | cspell.json, .markdownlint-cli2.yaml |
| 7 | Secrets | `detect-secrets-hook --baseline .secrets.baseline` | audit the baseline | changed files | pre-commit | every push | .secrets.baseline |
| 8 | Unit and property tests | `uv run --locked pytest -m "unit or property"` | none | tests | pre-push | every push | pytest.ini |
| 9 | Coverage | `uv run --locked pytest --cov` | none | full suite | manual | every push | coverage `fail_under` |
| 10 | Integration tests | `uv run --locked pytest -m integration` | none | integration tier | manual | pre-merge | pytest.ini |
| 11 | Dependency audit | AUDIT_COMMAND | update via the dependency bot | lockfiles | manual | push and weekly | n/a |
